// TEMP, absent from Renode's own nRF52840 platform.
//
// The SoftDevice starts a temperature measurement during initialisation and
// waits on EVENTS_DATARDY. Without this it waits for ever, having executed
// 28,000 instructions - which reads as a proprietary binary refusing to run
// rather than as a missing four-register peripheral.
temp: Sensors.NRF52840_Temp @ sysbus 0x4000C000
    IRQ -> nvic@12
